e (@sou). Views: 8; favorites: 4; remixes: 0.\nTags: hero, section, css, headline, marketing, interactive.\n## Overview\nAcoustic Topography Hero Section is designed for introducing a product with clear above-the-fold messaging. Key features include headline hierarchy, supporting copy, and a primary call-to-action. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for homepage hero areas and campaign landing pages.\n\nMeridian Topography Synthesis Telemetry Enterprise Log in Deploy Node Establishing Vector Coordinates Locate absolute acoustic precision. Traverse an infinite topology of spatial environments and synthetic intelligence.…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Locate absolute acoustic precision..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #06B6D4, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #22D3EE, background #000000, surface #4B5563, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Acoustic Topography</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#000000] text-gray-100 font-sans antialiased overflow-x-hidden min-h-screen relative selection:bg-cyan-500/30 selection:text-white flex flex-col\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL-style 3D Particle Background -->\n    <canvas id=\"webgl-bg\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-60\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Base Grid Overlay -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-[0.03]\" style=\"background-size: 48px 48px; background-image: linear-gradient(to right, white 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(to bottom, white 1px, transparent 1px); mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at center, black 40%, transparent 100%); -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at center, black 40%, transparent 100%);\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Progressive Blur Overlays (Top) -->\n    <div class=\"fixed top-0 inset-x-0 h-16 z-40 pointer-events-none backdrop-blur-[2px]\" style=\"mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 0%, transparent 100%); -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 0%, transparent 100%);\"></div>\n    <div class=\"fixed top-0 inset-x-0 h-32 z-40 pointer-events-none backdrop-blur-[6px]\" style=\"mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 0%, transparent 100%); -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 0%, transparent 100%);\"></div>\n    <div class=\"fixed top-0 inset-x-0 h-48 z-40 pointer-events-none backdrop-blur-[12px]\" style=\"mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 0%, transparent 100%); -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, black 0%, transparent 100%);\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Progressive Blur Overlays (Bottom) -->\n    <div class=\"fixed bottom-0 inset-x-0 h-24 z-40 pointer-events-none backdrop-blur-[2px]\" style=\"mask-image: linear-gradient(to top, black 0%, transparent 100%); -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to top, black 0%, transparent 100%);\"></div>\n    <div class=\"fixed bottom-0 inset-x-0 h-48 z-40 pointer-events-none backdrop-blur-[6px]\" style=\"mask-image: linear-gradient(to top, black 0%, transparent 100%); -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to top, black 0%, transparent 100%);\"></div>\n    <div class=\"fixed bottom-0 inset-x-0 h-72 z-40 pointer-events-none backdrop-blur-[12px]\" style=\"mask-image: linear-gradient(to top, black 0%, transparent 100%); -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to top, black 0%, transparent 100%);\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Navigation -->\n    <nav class=\"w-full px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between z-50 relative border-b border-white/[0.06] bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-xl\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 cursor-pointer group\">\n            <div class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-md border border-white/10 bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-800 to-black flex items-center justify-center shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.2)] group-hover:border-cyan-500/50 transition-colors duration-500\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:radar-linear\" class=\"text-white text-base\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"text-sm font-medium tracking-tight text-white/90\">Meridian</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 text-sm font-normal text-gray-400\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\">Topography</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\">Synthesis</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\">Telemetry</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\">Enterprise</a>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-6 text-sm font-normal\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300 hidden sm:block\">Log in</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"px-4 py-1.5 rounded-md bg-white text-black hover:bg-gray-200 transition-all font-medium flex items-center gap-2 shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(255,255,255,0.15)] hover:shadow-[0_0_25px_rgba(255,255,255,0.3)]\">\n                Deploy Node\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Main Hero Content -->\n    <main class=\"flex-grow flex flex-col items-center justify-start pt-24 md:pt-32 relative z-20 w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 overflow-hidden\">\n\n        <!-- Text Section -->\n        <div class=\"text-center flex flex-col items-center max-w-3xl mx-auto relative z-30\">\n\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-cyan-500/30 bg-cyan-950/20 text-cyan-300 text-xs font-normal mb-8 hover:bg-cyan-900/30 hover:border-cyan-400/50 transition-all backdrop-blur-md group\">\n                <span class=\"relative flex h-1.5 w-1.5\">\n                    <span class=\"animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-cyan-400 opacity-75\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"relative inline-flex rounded-full h-1.5 w-1.5 bg-cyan-500\"></span>\n                </span>\n                Establishing Vector Coordinates\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform opacity-70\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n            </a>\n\n            <h1 class=\"text-5xl md:text-7xl font-medium tracking-tight mb-6 leading-tight text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-b from-white via-gray-200 to-gray-600\">\n                Locate absolute <br class=\"hidden sm:block\" />\n                acoustic precision.\n            </h1>\n\n            <p class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-gray-400 max-w-lg mx-auto mb-10 font-normal leading-relaxed\">\n                Traverse an infinite topology of spatial environments and synthetic intelligence. The definitive calibration instrument for rendering exact audio orientations.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Compass & Targeting Interface -->\n        <div class=\"relative w-full h-[450px] md:h-[600px] mt-4 flex justify-center items-center z-20 pointer-events-none select-none\">\n\n            <!-- Compass Dial Container -->\n            <div class=\"relative w-[700px] h-[700px] md:w-[900px] md:h-[900px] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center translate-y-[15%] pointer-events-auto\">\n\n                <!-- Core Glow -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-[30%] bg-cyan-500/10 rounded-full blur-[120px]\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Structural Rings -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-[5%] rounded-full border border-white/[0.04] bg-gradient-to-b from-white/[0.01] to-transparent backdrop-blur-sm\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-[18%] rounded-full border border-white/[0.06] shadow-[inset_0_0_60px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)]\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Precision SVG Compass Details -->\n                <svg class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full opacity-60 pointer-events-none\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\">\n                    <!-- Fine 1-degree marks (360) -->\n                    <!-- Circumference ~301.59 for r=48 -->\n                    <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"48\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4b5563\" stroke-width=\"0.1\" stroke-dasharray=\"0.1 0.737\" />\n                    <!-- 10-degree marks (36) -->\n                    <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"47.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#9ca3af\" stroke-width=\"0.3\" stroke-dasharray=\"0.2 8.09\" />\n                    <!-- 90-degree thick marks (4) -->\n                    <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"47\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#06b6d4\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"0.5 73.3\" stroke-dashoffset=\"0.25\" />\n\n                    <!-- Inner telemetry rings -->\n                    <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"32\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"0.05\" opacity=\"0.3\" />\n                    <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#06b6d4\" stroke-width=\"0.1\" stroke-dasharray=\"0.5 1.5\" opacity=\"0.5\" />\n                    <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"0.05\" opacity=\"0.2\" />\n\n                    <!-- Targeting Crosshairs -->\n                    <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"98\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"0.05\" opacity=\"0.2\" />\n                    <line x1=\"2\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"98\" y2=\"50\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"0.05\" opacity=\"0.2\" />\n\n                    <!-- Bearing Lines to nodes -->\n                    <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"28.7\" y2=\"28.7\" stroke=\"#06b6d4\" stroke-width=\"0.1\" stroke-dasharray=\"1 1\" opacity=\"0.4\" />\n                    <line x1=\"50\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"78.2\" y2=\"33.5\" stroke=\"#06b6d4\" stroke-width=\"0.1\" stroke-dasharray=\"1 1\" opacity=\"0.4\" />\n                </svg>\n\n                <!-- Cardinal Telemetry Labels -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-[3%] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 flex flex-col items-center gap-1\">\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-cyan-400 tracking-widest\">000°</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-[10px] font-normal text-gray-500 tracking-widest\">TRUE NORTH</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-[3%] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 flex flex-col items-center gap-1\">\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-gray-400 tracking-widest\">180°</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"absolute left-[3%] top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 flex flex-col items-center gap-1\">\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-gray-400 tracking-widest\">270°</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"absolute right-[3%] top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 flex flex-col items-center gap-1\">\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-gray-400 tracking-widest\">090°</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Radar Sweep Overlay -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-[18%] rounded-full overflow-hidden z-10 mask-image-[radial-gradient(circle,white_0%,transparent_100%)]\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-[-50%] animate-[spin_6s_linear_infinite] origin-center\" style=\"background: conic-gradient(from 0deg at 50% 50%, transparent 70%, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.03) 85%, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.15) 98%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6) 100%);\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Node Interface Components -->\n\n                <!-- Central Origin Hub -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-30 flex flex-col items-center group cursor-pointer\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-[-40%] rounded-full border border-cyan-500/20 animate-[ping_4s_cubic-bezier(0,0,0.2,1)_infinite]\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"relative w-24 h-24 md:w-32 md:h-32 rounded-full p-1 bg-black border border-white/10 shadow-[0_0_50px_rgba(6,182,212,0.15)] group-hover:border-cyan-500/50 transition-colors duration-500\">\n                        <div class=\"w-full h-full rounded-full overflow-hidden bg-gray-900 relative\">\n                            <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544005313-94ddf0286df2?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=200&h=200\" alt=\"Origin Vector\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover opacity-80 mix-blend-luminosity group-hover:mix-blend-normal group-hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-500\" />\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                        <!-- Center Target Reticle -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-cyan-400 rounded-full shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(34,211,238,1)]\"></div>\n                        <!-- Orbital Ring -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute -inset-3 rounded-full border border-white/5 border-dashed animate-[spin_20s_linear_infinite_reverse]\"></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Center Telemetry Readout -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute -bottom-14 flex flex-col items-center bg-black/60 px-3 py-1.5 rounded border border-white/5 backdrop-blur-md\">\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-white\">Origin Node</span>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-0.5\">\n                            <span class=\"text-[10px] text-cyan-400/80 font-mono\">LAT: 34.05°</span>\n                            <span class=\"text-[10px] text-cyan-400/80 font-mono\">LON: 118.24°</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Alpha Sector Node (NW) -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-[21.3%] left-[21.3%] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-20 flex flex-col items-center group cursor-pointer\">\n                    <div class=\"relative w-12 h-12 rounded-full p-0.5 bg-black border border-white/10 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:border-cyan-400 transition-all duration-300\">\n                        <div class=\"w-full h-full rounded-full overflow-hidden grayscale opacity-60 group-hover:grayscale-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-300\">\n                            <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507003211169-0a1dd7228f2d?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=150&h=150\" alt=\"Alpha Vector\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" />\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-1 h-1 bg-white rounded-full\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute -right-16 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 flex flex-col bg-black/80 px-2 py-1 rounded border border-white/5 backdrop-blur-md\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[10px] font-medium text-gray-300\">Alpha-1</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-[9px] font-mono text-cyan-500\">BRG: 315°</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Beta Sector Node (ENE) -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-[33.5%] right-[21.8%] translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-20 flex flex-col items-center group cursor-pointer\">\n                    <div class=\"relative w-10 h-10 rounded-full p-0.5 bg-black border border-white/10 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:border-indigo-400 transition-all duration-300\">\n                        <div class=\"w-full h-full rounded-full overflow-hidden grayscale opacity-60 group-hover:grayscale-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-300\">\n                            <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=150&h=150\" alt=\"Beta Vector\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\" />\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute -left-16 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 flex flex-col items-end bg-black/80 px-2 py-1 rounded border border-white/5 backdrop-blur-md\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[10px] font-medium text-gray-300\">Beta-2</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-[9px] font-mono text-indigo-400\">BRG: 060°</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Floating Data Particles -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-[40%] left-[25%] w-1 h-1 bg-cyan-400 rounded-full animate-pulse z-10 shadow-[0_0_8px_2px_rgba(34,211,238,0.6)]\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-[35%] right-[30%] w-0.5 h-0.5 bg-white rounded-full animate-ping z-10 shadow-[0_0_5px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.8)]\"></div>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- WebGL-style 3D Sphere Script -->\n    <script>\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('webgl-bg');\n        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n        let width, height;\n        let particles = [];\n        const particleCount = 400;\n\n        function resize() {\n            width = canvas.width = window.innerWidth;\n            height = canvas.height = window.innerHeight;\n        }\n        window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n        resize();\n\n        // Generate spherical distribution\n        for(let i = 0; i < particleCount; i++) {\n            let phi = Math.acos(-1 + (2 * i) / particleCount);\n            let theta = Math.sqrt(particleCount * Math.PI) * phi;\n            let x = Math.cos(theta) * Math.sin(phi);\n            let y = Math.sin(theta) * Math.sin(phi);\n            let z = Math.cos(phi);\n            particles.push({x, y, z});\n        }\n\n        let time = 0;\n        function animate() {\n            ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n            time += 0.0015;\n\n            ctx.save();\n            ctx.translate(width / 2, height / 2);\n\n            // Subtle vertical tilt\n            const tilt = Math.PI / 8;\n            const cosTilt = Math.cos(tilt);\n            const sinTilt = Math.sin(tilt);\n\n            particles.forEach(p => {\n                // Rotate around Y axis\n                let rotX = p.x * Math.cos(time) - p.z * Math.sin(time);\n                let rotZ = p.x * Math.sin(time) + p.z * Math.cos(time);\n\n                // Apply tilt\n                let finalY = p.y * cosTilt - rotZ * sinTilt;\n                let finalZ = p.y * sinTilt + rotZ * cosTilt;\n\n                // Perspective projection\n                let radius = Math.min(width, height) * 0.45;\n                let scale = 300 / (300 + finalZ * 150);\n                let x2d = rotX * radius * scale;\n                let y2d = finalY * radius * scale;\n\n                // Draw point\n                let alpha = (scale - 0.5) * 1.5; // Fade distant points\n                if(alpha > 0) {\n                    ctx.beginPath();\n                    ctx.arc(x2d, y2d, scale * 1.2, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n                    ctx.fillStyle = `rgba(160, 200, 255, ${Math.min(alpha, 0.4)})`;\n                    ctx.fill();\n                }\n            });\n\n            ctx.restore();\n            requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n        }\n        animate();\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "acoustic-topography.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/acoustic-topography.jpg", "source_name": "acoustic-topography-DESIGN.md", "views": 82, "forks": 3, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "8bd0314a-9525-4a13-996e-2c37cbd9e514", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-01T23:30:43.715833+00:00"}